                "text": "Medicare Advantage aims to provide beneficiaries better health outcomes at a lower cost compared to traditional Medicare, yet administrative burdens can delay care and impact quality.\n\nAt this week's Ways and Means Joint Health and Oversight Subcommittee Hearing, I spoke about how prior authorization reform can\u00a0relieve these burdens and strengthen our healthcare system.",
