                "text": "I know I don\u2019t have all the answers, that\u2019s why I created the Health Advisory Council. This group of healthcare professionals from Northeast Ohio provides a collaborative forum to share insights on the key healthcare challenges facing our region. Their expertise helps shape solutions that inform federal policy and advance the priorities that matter most to patients and providers in OH-07.",
