                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "5/5 Democrats are not negotiating in good faith\n\nPresident Trump signed our Working Families Tax Cut into law on July 4th, which now prohibits taxpayer-funded health benefits from going to illegal immigrants. House and Senate Democrats have demanded a repeal of that prohibition to reopen the government! (See p. 57, Sec. 2141 of their CR counterproposal.) Democrats know this, and they are not telling the truth.\n\nNow they\u2019re trying to pass off blame for a so-called \u201chealth care crisis\u201d they created. Enough is enough. It's time for Democrats to vote to reopen the government!",
